task.ask_about_this_video.dictionary_searchable_answer.bug (completed) {
  in task.ask_about_this_video.dictionary_searchable_answer, when i click on the word on the answer, it should show another popup with the dictionary answer streaming

  Root cause:
  #popup used z-index 58, exactly the same as #video-panel. Because #popup
  appears earlier in the DOM, the video modal painted over it, so the lookup
  stream did start but was invisible behind the modal.

  Implemented:
  app/chat.html
  - Raised #popup to z-index 80, above the video panel (58), learn panel (59),
  and maximized player (70), so word clicks inside in-modal answers show the
  streaming dictionary popup on top of the video modal.
}

